15-10-15:
The oversightThe three Levites here named were in charge of the material
requirements and financial affairs of the Temple. They are also mentioned in Neh. 8:7;
12:34, 42 as prominent Levites (see 1 Chron. 26:29).

15-12-13:
Remember meSimilar requests by Nehemiah are recorded in chs. 5:19; 13:31;
etc.
Offices. Rather, “observations,” as in the margin, or “service” (RSV).
